ligned}],\n$$\n\nwhere ${x}_{2}\\in R.$ This implies that\n\n$$\nB={[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}\n$$\n\nis a basis of $\\text{Null}(A)$ since it is a linearly independent set and its vectors generate the $\\text{Null}(A).$" 13194139535445 true] [17592186349500 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349501 13194139535445 true] [17592186349500 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349502 13194139535445 true] [17592186349500 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349503 13194139535445 true] [17592186349500 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349504 13194139535445 true] [17592186349500 1000 #edb/ref 17592186349505 13194139535445 true] [17592186349500 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535445 true] [17592186349500 1041 "selection" 13194139535445 true] [17592186349500 1104 #edb/ref 17592186349504 13194139535445 true] [17592186349500 1110 #uuid "e44b1ae3-efbd-5cfd-b72a-3e1cac1855f7" 13194139535445 true] [17592186349501 1034 "B={\\,}" 13194139535445 true] [17592186349501 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535445 true] [17592186349501 1111 #uuid "318a9f04-e408-548f-b246-fa387985cc40" 13194139535445 true] [17592186349502 1034 "B={[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139535445 true] [17592186349502 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535445 true] [17592186349502 1111 #uuid "66cd3ef6-e517-578f-ac2a-1939c1155392" 13194139535445 true] [17592186349503 1034 "B={[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139535445 true] [17592186349503 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535445 true] [17592186349503 1111 #uuid "d1595f7e-4a5d-51ce-9d77-d992986773fe" 13194139535445 true] [17592186349504 1034 "B={[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139535445 true] [17592186349504 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535445 true] [17592186349504 1111 #uuid "ec81cf60-eb23-50c7-b7c7-795623b43327" 13194139535445 true] [17592186349505 1034 "B={[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}" 13194139535445 true] [17592186349505 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 1